{"time": 1751130216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728030889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看成掉头发了）"}
{"time": 1751130424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17426743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "岩垣彻——你的养父坐在桌对面，目光看向窗外，偶尔看你一眼，又转过头去。良久，等你吃完，他才又看着你"}
{"time": 1751130444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657951148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么样？有信心吗？”"}
{"time": 1751130511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318295325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1282262051]你无从得知，但你确信在今晚之前，没有这样的变化"}
{"time": 1751130527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395256960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "擦擦脸，看看镜子里的头发，转身问夏弥，\"夏弥...你看看我的头发，这是掉色了吗？\""}
{"time": 1751130561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106226014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉很简单的样子，会赢的”"}
{"time": 1751130573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321467187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是要去猎龙吗）"}
{"time": 1751130669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762475741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=395256960]你洗漱的功夫，夏弥竟也离开了被窝“嗯……？少白头？”"}
{"time": 1751130754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191018155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“五...感觉..卧挺腻害的”边吃边说话，以至于发音不是那么准确"}
{"time": 1751130758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341889043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低头抱住她，泪眼婆娑\"这怎么半啦，我才十八诶...\""}
{"time": 1751130977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018209544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=106226014]你知道试炼的规则——年龄合适的孩子们会在一年之中的某天，准备好装备和补给，朝着村外的溪流深处前进，向温和的自然与野蛮的怪物展现自己的生命力，并与之拼尽一切力量和狡诈，猎杀你能打倒的最强大的怪物，并将你的战利品带回村子\n“切不可轻敌，你每次都这么说”岩垣彻叹了口气“山中的怪物，比不得训练场里那些被拔了牙的东西，那些只能算家畜……我知道你已经听烦了我这些话，但是这次一定要往心里去”"}
{"time": 1751131087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363247720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“知道了，父亲，不用担心我了，我会小心的”"}
{"time": 1751131091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347484949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1341889043]“开玩笑啦……我们钢龙到了年纪表皮似乎也会变红……说不定这是你在成长的表现？”她伸手搓了搓你的头发"}
{"time": 1751131122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637522589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"成长?不会褪色吧..我好喜欢我现在的头发的..\""}
{"time": 1751131233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971677975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我吃饱了”"}
{"time": 1751131249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020721000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#拿纸巾擦擦嘴"}
{"time": 1751131286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025960247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1363247720]“嗯……我……算了，没什么”他似乎有话梗在了喉头，最后还是咽了回去“别勉强，遇到没有把握的，就算了，就算什么也没带回来，也没人怪你”"}
{"time": 1751131377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132955569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=637522589]“不知道，不知道啦。我连自己的身体都不完全了解”"}
{"time": 1751131392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774563226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一定会带最厉害的怪物回来的，放心吧父亲，毕竟我要成为世界第一猎人”"}
{"time": 1751131401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364680033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（罗罗诺亚索隆说是）"}
{"time": 1751131420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855474622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=132955569]“不过说不定，和灵峰上的那个家伙有关系”"}
{"time": 1751131425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256749460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹口气，\"那要不要把这缕头发剪掉啦...看着和我的栗色头发好不和谐...\""}
{"time": 1751131472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543274983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1256749460]“剪掉有些可惜……而且不对称，染一下吧？”"}
{"time": 1751131531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31749644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"摸摸她的头发，\"今天做什么发型?"}
{"time": 1751131606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909122137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我出门了”"}
{"time": 1751131659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234622061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774563226]“……”你的养父叹气扶额，似乎有些无语，不过还没反驳你“这次，村里还有两个和你同年的孩子，会和你一起进山。我知道你们关系不算好，但是也都是我看着长大的……要是有解决不了的情况，别逞强，在包里我给你放了信号弹”"}
{"time": 1751131704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829922216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=31749644]“嗯……和你一样就好了”"}
{"time": 1751131793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197340930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=909122137]你知道，按正规流程，试炼者要先去村口集结，再在村子祈福后一同出发"}
{"time": 1751131799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964293402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的好的”听到其他人的时候就敷衍的应付"}
{"time": 1751131822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854467809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等着我的好消息吧”"}
{"time": 1751131824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358447508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把她按在梳妆镜前，\"那今天梳一个简单的发髻吧。\""}
{"time": 1751131903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578176546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854467809]（急什么，你换衣服了吗）"}
{"time": 1751132035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007592167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的好的）"}
{"time": 1751132065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628765986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#去换衣服，顺便整理一下自己的发型"}
{"time": 1751132076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40576586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1358447508]你给夏弥编着今日的发型，她哼着与晴天相符的不知名调调——听她哼曲是一种独特的体验，她气息稳而长，如同绵延的风绕过山林，又回到你耳边——你给她编完，又巧妙地把自己褪色的那一小截头发编到里侧，这时，有人敲门"}
{"time": 1751132152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264865725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"心情很好，走上前打开房门，一边开口\"让我猜猜是不是小觉?\""}
{"time": 1751132261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60128413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1628765986]盔甲——与怪物贴身搏斗，不可或缺的保命手段。可惜的是，即便你训练有素，金属盔甲对你来说也太过厚重，好在大多数中小型怪物以齿爪的攻击最具威胁，而包有皮革的怪物骨架对这类攻击的防护性比起薄铁甲也不遑多让"}
{"time": 1751132267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457409039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（dr1/-）"}
{"time": 1751132372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325008354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751132381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859081469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，希望我不要被一爪子拍死）"}
{"time": 1751132408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "151843277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=264865725]“猜的真准”觉穿着那套包着粉色皮毛的蛮颚龙鳞甲，插着一边腰，飒爽地站在门外，和你第一次见到她的时候差不多——至少看起来差不多"}
{"time": 1751132423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462882825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1859081469]（人之常情）"}
{"time": 1751132466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048547328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1628765986]你换完衣服，才注意到你的父亲穿着的也是正装，看起来打算和你一起出门"}
{"time": 1751132473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690924346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃，养父）"}
{"time": 1751132481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595566079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有没有守护者铠甲发我）"}
{"time": 1751132484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758399374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己还穿着浴袍，\"诶?怎么一大早就装备上了，小觉，要做什么吗？今天\""}
{"time": 1751132497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115892387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲要去哪？”"}
{"time": 1751132529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665290722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=115892387]“先送你到村口”他站起身来，拎起你的包"}
{"time": 1751132634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233718818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#思考一下还有没有什么没干的事情"}
{"time": 1751132734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014222455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758399374]“嗯……我想去确认一下心情”她往后退了两步，靠在走廊的柱子上“而且，从贝鲁纳村离家出走的时候，除了这身，我可是一件武器都没带。反正我也不会别的，要不一起进山去看看？”"}
{"time": 1751132762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656414193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1233718818]可能，没了吧"}
{"time": 1751132787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87730962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就出发吧”#出门的时候记得锁门"}
{"time": 1751132815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805804321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啊，夏弥要不要一起?\"走回去挑一挑今天穿什么衣服"}
{"time": 1751132908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615896040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=805804321]“好啊，就当踏青了”"}
{"time": 1751133036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793867506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#今天天气怎么样"}
{"time": 1751133093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187566518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=87730962]今天的天气略有些沉闷，不过对早春来说，温度倒是刚好，大概是雨过天晴的缘故。岩垣彻帮你提着包，从村西的居民区穿过几条巷弄，朝东边去。马上要到那条阳光普照、纵贯南北的阶梯了，她突然把包塞到你面前"}
{"time": 1751133108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836659725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=805804321]（你带了什么）"}
{"time": 1751133118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140712487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是，你真的有装备吗）"}
{"time": 1751133143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638106913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿两套黑色的同款裙子，带上自己的冷色长剑，\"唔...我的护甲好像不怎么样，这之后拜托夏弥了。\""}
{"time": 1751133149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579087543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我冰鱼龙啊)"}
{"time": 1751133179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060036160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我都忘了）"}
{"time": 1751133205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670966188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#接过包“我会小心的，父亲不用担心了”"}
{"time": 1751133260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982254638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(反正不怎么样你知道的)"}
{"time": 1751133372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808559629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，不过...我这护甲碰到一般的怪物还是没什么问题的。\"挽起夏弥，\"走吧。\"往村口走"}
{"time": 1751133373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255681185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他似乎总算松了口气，看起来前半句比后半句让人舒心地多。他把手按在你背后，轻轻推着你一起往前迈入阳光中。村口，另外两个同龄人也刚刚到来。"}
{"time": 1751133435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853035890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=808559629]你们三人离开集会所大门，目光自然而然顺着楼梯向下，发现村口围着不少人"}
{"time": 1751133450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391198686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=255681185][CQ:at,qq=825734198] #看看是谁"}
{"time": 1751133460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843004932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点经典）"}
{"time": 1751133467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063381617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实你可以自定义你的npc）"}
{"time": 1751133552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9746973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没事，那就是路人甲和路人乙了）"}
{"time": 1751133576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112272616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（强者总是孤独的（bushi）"}
{"time": 1751133578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686494453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走过去看看，\"这是怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1751133647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572431254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "于此同时，村长——一位自打你记事起，容貌似乎一直不曾改变的女性龙人，身着白色里襟和云霞般紫色的和服，从台阶上漫步走下"}
{"time": 1751133867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1443623957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听一听人群的议论，看看发生了什么"}
{"time": 1751133930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618558283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391198686]另外两个，都是男生，其中一位是与你有过顽劣过节的伊藤阳太，背后背着一把折叠弓，另一位是看起来内向但可靠的北原苍介，同样背着一把太刀"}
{"time": 1751134063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010237175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#不理他们，先去集合"}
{"time": 1751134231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503252545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“诸君，早上好”女村长开口，将本就不算热闹的人声压下大半，随后她的目光一一扫过你们，带着自然的微笑“早上好，苍介；早上好，露儿；早上好，阳太”"}
{"time": 1751134294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959475120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好，村长大人”"}
{"time": 1751134458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066467375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她朝你点点头，随后再次开口，对着人群“大家此刻，聚集在这里，我想都带着和我一样的目的——为了祝福结云村的孩子，在伟大而不可预知的狩猎之路上，踏出宝贵的第一步，并期待他们的归来”"}
{"time": 1751134468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536349057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1443623957]你自然也听到了"}
{"time": 1751134550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427784521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，令人怀念啊”觉站在外层，露出有些复杂的神情“居然到了这里还正好赶上这个”"}
{"time": 1751134738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966239430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦吼?那我们正好可以跟着他们。\""}
{"time": 1751134761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094830407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也算是暗中保护保护他们了。\"窃笑，\"我当初可没这个待遇\""}
{"time": 1751135039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799043650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着人群离开"}
{"time": 1751135085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859689836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2066467375]“昨夜雨疏风骤，今朝彩彻区明。我想，这是神明照拂，为我们未来出色的猎人们扫去阴霾。而我们，也要为我们的孩子们送上祝福——‘愿雨水涤净你的锋刃和伤口’”从第二句开始，陆续有围着的猎人加入其中——他们每个人都曾听过“‘愿清风指引你的箭矢和猎物，愿太阳给你带来温暖和力量，愿月亮给你带来冷静与智慧——愿你的心跳，永远自由’”"}
{"time": 1751135107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884927567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，文本还是太长了）"}
{"time": 1751135113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868101356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不可避免地有点拖节奏）"}
{"time": 1751135117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598193268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#跟着一起复读"}
{"time": 1751135181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305151067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=859689836]直到最后一句，围观的每一个人都加入其中，以及分不清某一个人的声音，在山间久久回荡"}
{"time": 1751135271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477658605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094830407]“这样好吗？”觉跟在你旁边“毕竟是试炼……虽然我也喜欢团圆的结局，但试炼……就是残酷的东西”"}
{"time": 1751135307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433481777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，只是暗中帮帮啦。\"路过的时候打量一下要参加试炼的几个人。"}
{"time": 1751135364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647900780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "赫然是一个脆皮弓手和两个虾头太刀"}
{"time": 1751135459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417387625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1598193268]“那么，时间到了，孩子们。该去为自己的故事写下开篇了”村长抬手，指向溪流蜿蜒、群山怀抱的河谷"}
{"time": 1751135548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328253237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#出发出发"}
{"time": 1751135560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714961718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1433481777]“嗯……好吧，本来想由着性子走走的。不过看起来得下次了。看看他们运气如何咯”"}
{"time": 1751135613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695626886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这配置...\"有些无语地看着，\"勉强跟着吧。\""}
{"time": 1751135621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886505024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一同离开村子"}
{"time": 1751135677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003159294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#和那两个人分开走"}
{"time": 1751135794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682201483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?\"在后面打量着，\"我们也分开走走?\""}
{"time": 1751135833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216284607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在发觉你打算单走的时候，苍介犹豫了片刻，出声叫住了你“岩垣”他自然叫的是你的姓“我们还是一起行动吧。互相之间有个照应，以免遇上突发情况”"}
{"time": 1751135894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398886424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（顺便一提）"}
{"time": 1751135907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582154768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们很熟吗？哼”"}
{"time": 1751136010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666272293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1682201483]在后面停住脚步，看向觉"}
{"time": 1751136012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395044783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的包里，放了4瓶回复药（回复25%hp），5根药草（10%hp，可以调和制成回复药），些许肉干，还有一块砥石，以及两管信号弹"}
{"time": 1751136102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945668620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过你们遇到危险的话，到时候求求我，也会救你们的”"}
{"time": 1751136103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596245039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1582154768]苍介噎住了，本来就不外向的他不知道怎么接你的话。阳太嘴角抽了抽“我们可是为你好”"}
{"time": 1751136141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35055008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=666272293]觉点了点头“我是没关系，不过怎么分配？”"}
{"time": 1751136147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183912789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#不理他直接走"}
{"time": 1751136151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117040488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我跟着这小姑娘吧，有点意思...\""}
{"time": 1751136205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069864903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔嗯……”夏弥不语，只是一味地不撒手"}
{"time": 1751136228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572158787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我就知道”觉抽了抽嘴角“好吧，我去跟另外那边”"}
{"time": 1751136308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749630701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"挽着夏弥跟上前面的小姑娘，\"那就傍晚见啦，今晚我请觉吃饭。\""}
{"time": 1751136315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876868099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=183912789]另外两个人试着跟着你，不过最后大概也是放下了住人情节"}
{"time": 1751136339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724106689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1749630701]“嚯……你当年居然半天就解决了？”"}
{"time": 1751136347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067957970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我很坏了）"}
{"time": 1751136509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032906180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像确实没这么花时间。\"挠挠头，\"我没什么印象啦，拜拜！\"挥挥手不远不近跟上前面的女孩"}
{"time": 1751136563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207110391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2067957970]从结云村出门，一路向东——山路仍带着能结出露水的潮气，一切硬的东西都滑溜溜，一切软的东西都黏糊糊。好在通往猎场的道路被不止千万遍踏过，并不容易滑倒。那两人选择的道路偏南，而你，自然会选择偏北？"}
{"time": 1751136626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755397003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#那就一路向北"}
{"time": 1751136864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866496641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此刻正是南方的冬春之交，已经有些植物开始抽出新叶，竹笋也开始冒尖，有些啮齿类动物从冬眠中苏醒，吵的像居酒屋的后厨，让山路不至于显得太过枯燥……但不枯燥不太可能，毕竟最近的猎场也离村子有30里"}
{"time": 1751137095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114710568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但路上也不至于没有可选的目标——显然，猎场远是因为离村近的区域在猎人的刻意清扫下，有威胁的目标不会被允许靠近村子，而温顺的草食种们，自然没有人希望他们远离村子"}
{"time": 1751137104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018361661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在后面观察着前面的小姑娘"}
{"time": 1751137117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137365636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#有草食龙吗"}
{"time": 1751137130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840226001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很可惜，没有）"}
{"time": 1751137142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693932354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（草食龙在北边一点的地方，不在热带）"}
{"time": 1751137164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713153231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（很可惜了）"}
{"time": 1751137226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281833609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这小姑娘倒是初生牛犊不怕虎\""}
{"time": 1751137317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511966010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#看看有没有什么值得注意的痕迹"}
{"time": 1751137319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442506909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "比如——精灵鹿，还有丸鸟。前者是背上披着深绿保护色毛皮的小型四蹄怪物，抬起头大概也只到你胸口这么高，机警而敏捷，能在山涧中轻巧地跳跃。丸鸟，则是一种长腿长脖子、翅膀却异常短小的肥嘟嘟的大型鸟类，胆小而迟钝"}
{"time": 1751137331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779795240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以过一个难度6的怪物常识）"}
{"time": 1751137335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944204880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（dc6）"}
{"time": 1751137340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711300530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20-1"}
{"time": 1751137340, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1711300530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]演奏出: 1D20-1={16}-1=15"}
{"time": 1751137419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127604493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对着夏弥吐槽，保持一个不会被发现的距离"}
{"time": 1751137468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458431677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你知道的是，丸鸟在从背后受到惊吓或攻击时，会因为过度紧张而肌肉收缩，导致——运气好的时候，它会把蛋下下来\n而精灵鹿，雄性精灵鹿头上的角无论何时都非常具有药用价值"}
{"time": 1751137518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856248504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#周围有鸟吗，吓一只去"}
{"time": 1751137539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989884726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E9F384A05A569EA1FD0C30C85B9CD73B.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT2ASUchqi0iUtPtQJhwdCIgqof_hjqTCD_CijMiLLX55SOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCviPlSNEEZORnivd7r7NHlegJEGg&amp;rkey=CAISMArMjpcoiwsxSjkDJEVo6YiBQonzB9ufRX5QPfAxD542MTEfYIENh-IDT0d0jauUig,file_size=9834]"}
{"time": 1751137542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861663896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（丸鸟）"}
{"time": 1751137548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806061251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实挺大一只）"}
