{"time": 1751140576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523720596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"想了想也没带多少干粮，再喂几块饼干给夏弥，自己就不吃了"}
