{"time": 1751142378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "890929855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（失败li）"}
{"time": 1751142760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719416180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "初极狭，才通人，以至于你的太刀都有些不方便，略微费了点劲，也算顺利通过了，眼前的地形左高右低，左侧是高耸而嶙峋是石壁，中间是狭长平坦的石台，石台尽头有着坡道连向其他地方，右侧则由山体陡然变成断崖，看起来足有二十余米的落差。或许是因为没怎么起风，在你通过之后，才发现，地上躺着一具看起来还算新鲜的丸鸟尸体……应该说遗骸，羽毛和血迹还未干透，在它旁边，趴着几头嘴角沾着血迹，看起来正在午睡的小体型龙类"}
{"time": 1751142781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92819968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=4F2A4E4C2A7491ABF2DF1F6033D3271D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT4KFHq_4pg_EmBJCFFPynVNMtbkxj-kgkg_woo2Medm_uUjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQnr01YAn5eDoQawxhHZRqzXoCtmQ&amp;rkey=CAISMGxQunSy6jDC7xzXHLQ9IN9t686oOMfSwdDpeEU4LT0LSP1eMCxJMlYUOAReyYGtSw,file_size=149886]"}
{"time": 1751142836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198988616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#具体多少只"}
{"time": 1751142864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732934399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "体型细长，有着细长的吻部和如犬类般招风的耳廓。与前肢比起来腿部显然粗壮不少，看起来弹跳力不错"}
